<title>CROATIA: TENNIS-IVANISEVIC SHOWS IMPROVEMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-IVANISEVIC SHOWS IMPROVEMENT.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Defending champion Goran Ivanisevic raised his game on Thursday to reach the Croatian indoor tournament quarter-finals by beating Sweden's Thomas Johansson in straight sets.</p>
<p>Local hero Ivanisevic won 7-6 6-4 without apparent difficulty only a day after he had tested home fans' patience by almost losing to another Swede, Magnus Norman.</p>
<p>&quot;I played better today. The further I go in the tournament, the better I'll play,&quot; the world's number two promised.</p>
<p>Second-seeded Thomas Enqvist of Sweden reached the last eight by defeating Moroccan Karim Alami 6-3 6-0.</p>
</text>
